(1717642, 232374, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and use of desaturation. I like the grain it makes your subject look mysterious and the bright red lips shows seduction. Nice lighting, focus and background. The only destraction to me is the fact I can see color noise especially in the face and hands. Would of been great if the noise would of lacked color/tint. With all that said your photograph is still great (8).<br/>-SDW</td>', 'Nice composition and use of desaturation. I like the grain it makes your subject look mysterious and the bright red lips shows seduction. Nice lighting, focus and background. The only destraction to me is the fact I can see color noise especially in the face and hands. Would of been great if the noise would of lacked color/tint. With all that said your photograph is still great (8).-SDW', '2005-09-18 02:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717653, 232284, 1796, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Love the DOF, the greenish color cast, the lighting, the glasses, the angles of the guys'' looks/faces and the red color of the woman''s top. Really cool! one of the best I''ve seen so far, if not the best.<br/> <br/>9 from me</td>', 'Great shot! Love the DOF, the greenish color cast, the lighting, the glasses, the angles of the guys'' looks/faces and the red color of the woman''s top. Really cool! one of the best I''ve seen so far, if not the best. 9 from me', '2005-09-18 02:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717659, 232777, 1796, '<td valign="top">Huh?<br/> <br/>I don''t really see (or get) what you''re going at. The face-like structure (is it metal or a very plastered and post processed human face?) doesn''t say conspiracy to me and I wonder what it''s got to do with mental illness. Is this an attempt of yours to deal with something that happened to you or someone close to you?<br/> <br/>I was clinically depressed this summer and spent 10 weeks, drugged and suicidal, in a mental institution. So, if you were "kidding" or just plain playing around (with words), please don''t, because you''d obviously not know what you''re talking about if you haven''t been there yourself.<br/> <br/>If you have been there, all the best to you!</td>', 'Huh? I don''t really see (or get) what you''re going at. The face-like structure (is it metal or a very plastered and post processed human face?) doesn''t say conspiracy to me and I wonder what it''s got to do with mental illness. Is this an attempt of yours to deal with something that happened to you or someone close to you? I was clinically depressed this summer and spent 10 weeks, drugged and suicidal, in a mental institution. So, if you were "kidding" or just plain playing around (with words), please don''t, because you''d obviously not know what you''re talking about if you haven''t been there yourself. If you have been there, all the best to you!', '2005-09-18 02:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
