(1717777, 232662, 36628, '<td valign="top">He certainly does look like a conspirator...I just wish that this were a bit lighter, especiall on the dog. It took me a second look to get exactly what was going on, becasue so much of the detail on the dog is lost in shadow. You might try, depending on your editing program, a brightness increase on the whole photo and then a little dodging of the dog if hes still a little dark. Theres also an odd black line on the right side of the photo, not sure what thats about but it doesn''t look intentional and its not super obvious. I suppose it could be a good indication of how well people actually look at your photo :)</td>', 'He certainly does look like a conspirator...I just wish that this were a bit lighter, especiall on the dog. It took me a second look to get exactly what was going on, becasue so much of the detail on the dog is lost in shadow. You might try, depending on your editing program, a brightness increase on the whole photo and then a little dodging of the dog if hes still a little dark. Theres also an odd black line on the right side of the photo, not sure what thats about but it doesn''t look intentional and its not super obvious. I suppose it could be a good indication of how well people actually look at your photo :)', '2005-09-18 03:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
