(1717931, 232664, 27133, '<td valign="top">I wonder.....!  Well seen.  It just goes to show that the most simple of images can portray the most meaning.</td>', 'I wonder.....!  Well seen.  It just goes to show that the most simple of images can portray the most meaning.', '2005-09-18 06:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
