(1717937, 232647, 27133, '<td valign="top">So that is how I get a ribbon...DOH..........silly me!!  Thanks for informing us...LOL!!</td>', 'So that is how I get a ribbon...DOH..........silly me!!  Thanks for informing us...LOL!!', '2005-09-18 06:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
