(1717941, 232115, 27133, '<td valign="top">Excellent details especially on that nose.  The sunglasses...hmmm...I would like to know who is hiding behind them...LOL!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Excellent details especially on that nose.  The sunglasses...hmmm...I would like to know who is hiding behind them...LOL!! ', '2005-09-18 06:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717942, 232706, 27133, '<td valign="top">A well lit image with good details.  I wonder what does go on behind those windows.</td>', 'A well lit image with good details.  I wonder what does go on behind those windows.', '2005-09-18 06:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717943, 232772, 36628, '<td valign="top">Yah, I''m really glad I don''t have to buy gas right now, although I''m sure the prices are convenient for some people. Only thing is it might be a bit of a literal representation.</td>', 'Yah, I''m really glad I don''t have to buy gas right now, although I''m sure the prices are convenient for some people. Only thing is it might be a bit of a literal representation.', '2005-09-18 06:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
