(1717968, 232775, 3306, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2005-09-18 07:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717969, 232731, 36628, '<td valign="top">Its possible...I wish the guy on the rock wasnt quite so hidden, and the shot were a little bit brighter.</td>', 'Its possible...I wish the guy on the rock wasnt quite so hidden, and the shot were a little bit brighter.', '2005-09-18 07:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717970, 232087, 3306, '<td valign="top">Ah, they have finally been caught. Thank goodness. 1 (Just kidding on the 1!)</td>', 'Ah, they have finally been caught. Thank goodness. 1 (Just kidding on the 1!)', '2005-09-18 07:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717976, 232640, 3306, '<td valign="top">Creative and funny. Well done.</td>', 'Creative and funny. Well done.', '2005-09-18 07:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717978, 232563, 36628, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but it feels like the woody is just a little bit soft.</td>', 'I like the concept, but it feels like the woody is just a little bit soft.', '2005-09-18 07:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717982, 232617, 36628, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the calculator is for if you''ve already decided on 10''s or 1''s, but I like the mirrored sky alot. This has a very surreal feel to it.</td>', 'Not sure what the calculator is for if you''ve already decided on 10''s or 1''s, but I like the mirrored sky alot. This has a very surreal feel to it.', '2005-09-18 07:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717983, 232328, 30896, '<td valign="top">nice color and light, but that white thing is way too distracting here</td>', 'nice color and light, but that white thing is way too distracting here', '2005-09-18 07:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717984, 232292, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and photographed. Good job.</td>', 'Nicely composed and photographed. Good job.', '2005-09-18 07:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717988, 232742, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great imagination and play on words. Creatively done. Must have taken a while to set this one up.</td>', 'Great imagination and play on words. Creatively done. Must have taken a while to set this one up.', '2005-09-18 07:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717990, 232544, 36628, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the tones but the composition is a little bit weak to me. The blank brick on the left draws my attention away from what the focus should be, the main entryway.</td>', 'I like the concept and the tones but the composition is a little bit weak to me. The blank brick on the left draws my attention away from what the focus should be, the main entryway.', '2005-09-18 07:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717991, 232646, 3306, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard that before! Good job.</td>', 'I''ve heard that before! Good job.', '2005-09-18 07:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717994, 232563, 30896, '<td valign="top">good idea, just not sure whether the softness of the woodie works here, bit slippery to my eyes</td>', 'good idea, just not sure whether the softness of the woodie works here, bit slippery to my eyes', '2005-09-18 07:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717996, 232749, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very theatric. Well done.</td>', 'Very theatric. Well done.', '2005-09-18 07:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718001, 232716, 36628, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit too much a literal representation to me. You might want to check out this tutorial: //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=33</td>', 'This looks a bit too much a literal representation to me. You might want to check out this tutorial: //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=33', '2005-09-18 07:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718002, 232656, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a cute shot, but I''d like to see just a little bit more contrast. I''m also not too crazy about the downward angle of view, I think more of a straight on would have been more effective..</td>', 'This is a cute shot, but I''d like to see just a little bit more contrast. I''m also not too crazy about the downward angle of view, I think more of a straight on would have been more effective..', '2005-09-18 07:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718006, 232771, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice candid, the only two things I dont really like are the softness and the halo (which may be a result of the softness) I think a soft filter can add to a photo, but maybe only half as much as was used here. Some dodging/burning might help get rid of the resulted halo.</td>', 'This is a really nice candid, the only two things I dont really like are the softness and the halo (which may be a result of the softness) I think a soft filter can add to a photo, but maybe only half as much as was used here. Some dodging/burning might help get rid of the resulted halo.', '2005-09-18 07:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718010, 232558, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice picture, although I''m not quite sure I get its relevance to ''Conspiracy''. The only technical detail I don''t like is the watch face, which could be just a little bit darker.</td>', 'This is a really nice picture, although I''m not quite sure I get its relevance to ''Conspiracy''. The only technical detail I don''t like is the watch face, which could be just a little bit darker.', '2005-09-18 07:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718012, 232640, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot, but whats that thing sticking out of the top? Very original and one of my favorites in the challenge so far.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot, but whats that thing sticking out of the top? Very original and one of my favorites in the challenge so far.', '2005-09-18 07:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718013, 232355, 36628, '<td valign="top">The sky is nice, but this doesnt feel like much more than a snapshot. To really bring out impact you might try cropping out the blank space on the left side and darkening the foreground to sihlouette it against the sky.</td>', 'The sky is nice, but this doesnt feel like much more than a snapshot. To really bring out impact you might try cropping out the blank space on the left side and darkening the foreground to sihlouette it against the sky.', '2005-09-18 07:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718019, 232706, 36628, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t that one suck eh? This feels too dark, I think that you could lighten up the building quite a bit and then increase the contrast to give this shot alot more impact on the viewer.</td>', 'Wouldn''t that one suck eh? This feels too dark, I think that you could lighten up the building quite a bit and then increase the contrast to give this shot alot more impact on the viewer.', '2005-09-18 07:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718030, 232713, 36628, '<td valign="top">Meh, cats are better anyways! This photo works really well, the expressions all fit perfectly.  The only thing I''d suggest, was a little bit softer lighting to subdue the highlights on the left. To be nitpicky, you might also clone out the har coming off of the dogs paw :)</td>', 'Meh, cats are better anyways! This photo works really well, the expressions all fit perfectly.  The only thing I''d suggest, was a little bit softer lighting to subdue the highlights on the left. To be nitpicky, you might also clone out the har coming off of the dogs paw :)', '2005-09-18 08:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718033, 232292, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a really nicely done shot.</td>', 'This is a really nicely done shot.', '2005-09-18 08:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718034, 232688, 36628, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see something else in this shot to really make it apparent what you were talking about. Either the prices on the pumps, or on the main sign. The night-time colors are also a little bit weird, you might see if you like it any better in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I would have liked to see something else in this shot to really make it apparent what you were talking about. Either the prices on the pumps, or on the main sign. The night-time colors are also a little bit weird, you might see if you like it any better in B&W.', '2005-09-18 08:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718036, 232703, 36628, '<td valign="top">I don''t remember much about the movie, but I''m thinking Mel Gibson? This is a nice shot, only suggestion is to fix up the color around his right eye. It looks like it has a bit of a reddish cast to it. Maybe even tone down the reds a little in general too cool off the shot a bit.</td>', 'I don''t remember much about the movie, but I''m thinking Mel Gibson? This is a nice shot, only suggestion is to fix up the color around his right eye. It looks like it has a bit of a reddish cast to it. Maybe even tone down the reds a little in general too cool off the shot a bit.', '2005-09-18 08:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718037, 232191, 29658, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but don''t inspire conspiracy (apart the title)...</td>', 'Nice picture, but don''t inspire conspiracy (apart the title)...', '2005-09-18 08:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718038, 232749, 29658, '<td valign="top">Ribbon for you!</td>', 'Ribbon for you!', '2005-09-18 08:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718039, 232769, 36628, '<td valign="top">The only thing I don''t like about this shot is the apple. It seems a little bit too harshly lit in comparison with the books, and its a bit of a distraction to the overall impact.</td>', 'The only thing I don''t like about this shot is the apple. It seems a little bit too harshly lit in comparison with the books, and its a bit of a distraction to the overall impact.', '2005-09-18 08:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718041, 232328, 36628, '<td valign="top">Not sure I quite understand the intent? Whats the big white thing for? The eyes are well lit, but the overall red-orange hue is a little bit strange. The baby would make more impact agains a darker background - grey/blue/black.</td>', 'Not sure I quite understand the intent? Whats the big white thing for? The eyes are well lit, but the overall red-orange hue is a little bit strange. The baby would make more impact agains a darker background - grey/blue/black.', '2005-09-18 08:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718044, 232481, 36628, '<td valign="top">I think you could crop out a little bit of the left side, maybe in the middle of the tree, but I really like this shot. The black border certainly gives it a certain impact to the viewer, but I think it might be a little excessive. I do like the inner border.</td>', 'I think you could crop out a little bit of the left side, maybe in the middle of the tree, but I really like this shot. The black border certainly gives it a certain impact to the viewer, but I think it might be a little excessive. I do like the inner border.', '2005-09-18 08:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718045, 232651, 42899, '<td valign="top">Gee only volume one , there must be a whole library full of the 99 million other volumes , Well done very clever.</td>', 'Gee only volume one , there must be a whole library full of the 99 million other volumes , Well done very clever.', '2005-09-18 08:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718046, 232749, 36981, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites - really well done!  I love the lighting, and it made me laugh.</td>', 'One of my favorites - really well done!  I love the lighting, and it made me laugh.', '2005-09-18 08:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
