(1718123, 232651, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, like the colours and tones in this image.  I am not terribly fond of the composition though, I think I would have liked this image more if she were placed in the right corner of the frame and you would have had the same space to her left instead of her right.</td>', 'Nicely lit, like the colours and tones in this image.  I am not terribly fond of the composition though, I think I would have liked this image more if she were placed in the right corner of the frame and you would have had the same space to her left instead of her right.', '2005-09-18 09:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718125, 232516, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but way too much contrast for my taste, I definately want to see some texture and nuances in a photo and as far as I can see there are pretty much just two tones in the image, pitch black and deep red.  Just wanted to explain why I only gave it a 5.</td>', 'Nice composition but way too much contrast for my taste, I definately want to see some texture and nuances in a photo and as far as I can see there are pretty much just two tones in the image, pitch black and deep red.  Just wanted to explain why I only gave it a 5.', '2005-09-18 09:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718128, 232777, 36628, '<td valign="top">I think subtler lighting would help this shot out, making it a little bit darker overall and not as straight on the  face. The shadow of the head behind it is also a little weird and you might think about the color of the shirt and the background. The little patch of green and the patch of color on the bottom and top  right are a bit destracting from the emphasis of the face.  Sorry if this seems a bit harsh, this is just my oppinion on what might give the shot more impact on the viewer! Let me know if you''ve got any questions :)</td>', 'I think subtler lighting would help this shot out, making it a little bit darker overall and not as straight on the  face. The shadow of the head behind it is also a little weird and you might think about the color of the shirt and the background. The little patch of green and the patch of color on the bottom and top  right are a bit destracting from the emphasis of the face.  Sorry if this seems a bit harsh, this is just my oppinion on what might give the shot more impact on the viewer! Let me know if you''ve got any questions :)', '2005-09-18 09:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
