(1718229, 232110, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge!</td>', 'Great take on the challenge!', '2005-09-18 10:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718230, 232238, 36981, '<td valign="top">Very funny and great take on the challenge.</td>', 'Very funny and great take on the challenge.', '2005-09-18 10:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718231, 232408, 36628, '<td valign="top">Is that a sihlouette of a person on the right or just a part of the UFO? If a person I''d like to see just a little bit more of them to eliminate a person. I''m thinking not based on the little chip out of the left side as well. Anyways, those two little things are the only thing I really feel detracts from this. Lighting is superb, it almost looks like CG.</td>', 'Is that a sihlouette of a person on the right or just a part of the UFO? If a person I''d like to see just a little bit more of them to eliminate a person. I''m thinking not based on the little chip out of the left side as well. Anyways, those two little things are the only thing I really feel detracts from this. Lighting is superb, it almost looks like CG.', '2005-09-18 10:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718233, 232328, 36981, '<td valign="top">The doll is funny, but I''m not really getting it.  I don''t understand what the white thingy is, and I''m feeling stupid for missing it.</td>', 'The doll is funny, but I''m not really getting it.  I don''t understand what the white thingy is, and I''m feeling stupid for missing it.', '2005-09-18 10:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718234, 232664, 36981, '<td valign="top">Funny take on the challenge!  I like the idea, and the cats are cute.</td>', 'Funny take on the challenge!  I like the idea, and the cats are cute.', '2005-09-18 10:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718236, 232750, 34906, '<td valign="top">You really have that right!  Great way to take a super annoyance and have it represent your concept.</td>', 'You really have that right!  Great way to take a super annoyance and have it represent your concept.', '2005-09-18 10:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718237, 232700, 36981, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Very original, beautifully lit and funny to boot!</td>', 'Wonderful!  Very original, beautifully lit and funny to boot!', '2005-09-18 10:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718238, 232035, 36628, '<td valign="top">Gets the point across, but doesn''t strike me as terribly original. I''d have liked to see something like this with the directors ''cut'' thing that I don''t know the name for. On the other hand, no pun intended, I do like the consistant lighting between the photo and your hand so the detail is there.</td>', 'Gets the point across, but doesn''t strike me as terribly original. I''d have liked to see something like this with the directors ''cut'' thing that I don''t know the name for. On the other hand, no pun intended, I do like the consistant lighting between the photo and your hand so the detail is there.', '2005-09-18 10:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718239, 232441, 36981, '<td valign="top">V funny.  I''m not sure why the eggs are so black-speckled, but I suppose it adds to a film-noire type of look.</td>', 'V funny.  I''m not sure why the eggs are so black-speckled, but I suppose it adds to a film-noire type of look.', '2005-09-18 10:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718242, 232646, 36628, '<td valign="top">The treatment on this photo is really effective, but I don''t like the background. I think a solid-color would have been alot more effective. Kindof reminds me of the guy in  ''The Scream'' painting by Munch.</td>', 'The treatment on this photo is really effective, but I don''t like the background. I think a solid-color would have been alot more effective. Kindof reminds me of the guy in  ''The Scream'' painting by Munch.', '2005-09-18 10:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718246, 232658, 36628, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of these kinds of collage photos. I think it might work better on a solid backdrop with different lighting but here the wood floor, with the little spots, and the flat lighting don''t really make for a very visually engaging image.</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of these kinds of collage photos. I think it might work better on a solid backdrop with different lighting but here the wood floor, with the little spots, and the flat lighting don''t really make for a very visually engaging image.', '2005-09-18 10:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718248, 232099, 36628, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get this one...I''d also like to see the highlights subdued a little bit.</td>', 'Not sure I get this one...I''d also like to see the highlights subdued a little bit.', '2005-09-18 10:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718253, 232665, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a Great picture. Definately hope you reveal how you did this one. Love the distortion through the ice and the color is perfect!</td>', 'Wow! This is a Great picture. Definately hope you reveal how you did this one. Love the distortion through the ice and the color is perfect!', '2005-09-18 10:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718254, 232664, 36628, '<td valign="top">My parents, just yesterday,  decided that their cats are now strictly ''Indoor Only'' after a particularly rare bird ended up in pieces under my dad''s desk. I like the poses you caught them in, they seem particularly innocent...<br/> <br/>You might try cropping out some of the right side of the photo as all the space isnt totally necessary,</td>', 'My parents, just yesterday,  decided that their cats are now strictly ''Indoor Only'' after a particularly rare bird ended up in pieces under my dad''s desk. I like the poses you caught them in, they seem particularly innocent... You might try cropping out some of the right side of the photo as all the space isnt totally necessary,', '2005-09-18 10:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718257, 232731, 42638, '<td valign="top">Ah! Truth revealed! Great picture! Love the majesty of it. Nice use of people at the bottom to bring this out. Its a bit on the dark side but I think you intended that. Nice job!</td>', 'Ah! Truth revealed! Great picture! Love the majesty of it. Nice use of people at the bottom to bring this out. Its a bit on the dark side but I think you intended that. Nice job!', '2005-09-18 10:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718261, 232330, 35517, '<td valign="top">i love this.. my pic for the blue... great shot... congrats..10</td>', 'i love this.. my pic for the blue... great shot... congrats..10', '2005-09-18 10:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718264, 232608, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Nice representation.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Nice representation.', '2005-09-18 10:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718267, 232700, 42638, '<td valign="top">Love it! I like the perspiration on the caged egg! Really makes the picture.</td>', 'Love it! I like the perspiration on the caged egg! Really makes the picture.', '2005-09-18 10:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718268, 232794, 36628, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get the conspiracy, but now I''m hungry and those things are so good. I used to eat 20 of them every morning for breakfast...mmmm....<br/> <br/>I think you could heighten the impact of the photo by cropping the top space by about 1/2 and doing a little color correction to turn the background white instead of the sort of pale pink. It also looks like the right side managed to escape your border. For the boarder, with a photo like this (with so much white space) I''d have gone with black so it doesnt blend in to the top and sides.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get the conspiracy, but now I''m hungry and those things are so good. I used to eat 20 of them every morning for breakfast...mmmm.... I think you could heighten the impact of the photo by cropping the top space by about 1/2 and doing a little color correction to turn the background white instead of the sort of pale pink. It also looks like the right side managed to escape your border. For the boarder, with a photo like this (with so much white space) I''d have gone with black so it doesnt blend in to the top and sides.', '2005-09-18 10:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718271, 232701, 42638, '<td valign="top">I really had to think about this one. It wasn''t immediately clear. Maybe the glare at the top threw me. Nice interpretation.</td>', 'I really had to think about this one. It wasn''t immediately clear. Maybe the glare at the top threw me. Nice interpretation.', '2005-09-18 10:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718272, 232311, 37005, '<td valign="top">I know how hard reflections are to work with, especially with flash.  Great subject matter but I find myself extremely distracted by the flash reflection off of the red reflector.</td>', 'I know how hard reflections are to work with, especially with flash.  Great subject matter but I find myself extremely distracted by the flash reflection off of the red reflector.', '2005-09-18 10:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718273, 232265, 36628, '<td valign="top">Sure looks like the end is a little moist to me...<br/> <br/>I like this shot, the title and the border I think are essential but you didn''t have to force the ''conspiracy'' idea on the viewer.</td>', 'Sure looks like the end is a little moist to me... I like this shot, the title and the border I think are essential but you didn''t have to force the ''conspiracy'' idea on the viewer.', '2005-09-18 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
