(1718518, 232744, 36628, '<td valign="top">Technically this shot looks a little bit dark, I think a little more light might have helped it out alot. The focus also seems off, whether its from a longer shutter speed or from not being able to focus in the dark I''m not really sure. If your camera allows it, you might try a lower ISO to make the shot a little more clear.<br/> <br/>Compositionally all the empty space on top and on the right side detracts from the focus of the people, you might try cropping off 3/4 on top and 1/2 on the right. It also feels like its been forced into the challenge topic.</td>', 'Technically this shot looks a little bit dark, I think a little more light might have helped it out alot. The focus also seems off, whether its from a longer shutter speed or from not being able to focus in the dark I''m not really sure. If your camera allows it, you might try a lower ISO to make the shot a little more clear. Compositionally all the empty space on top and on the right side detracts from the focus of the people, you might try cropping off 3/4 on top and 1/2 on the right. It also feels like its been forced into the challenge topic.', '2005-09-18 12:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718522, 232313, 25397, '<td valign="top">The idea of Big Brother has ALWAYS creeped me out, I always feel like I''m being watched. The headset was a nice touch and overall a good composition and idea. I like the green tint, but I think it''s just a little too much green everywhere. I think if you desaturated half the colors, then applied a little bit of green tint with the color balance or another method, it would have looked a bet better. But anyway, good luck! 8</td>', 'The idea of Big Brother has ALWAYS creeped me out, I always feel like I''m being watched. The headset was a nice touch and overall a good composition and idea. I like the green tint, but I think it''s just a little too much green everywhere. I think if you desaturated half the colors, then applied a little bit of green tint with the color balance or another method, it would have looked a bet better. But anyway, good luck! 8', '2005-09-18 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718523, 232697, 25397, '<td valign="top">Well executed in hiding the evil radio tower, but overall this picture is too bright. There''s not much you can do to fix this because it''s just the sunny day, but a little bit of levels or curves adjustment would have benefitted.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Well executed in hiding the evil radio tower, but overall this picture is too bright. There''s not much you can do to fix this because it''s just the sunny day, but a little bit of levels or curves adjustment would have benefitted.Good luck!', '2005-09-18 12:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
