(1720435, 232640, 13879, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite of the whole challenge! Its really stands out from the crowd, and kudos for spotting it in the first place. If I were a betting man I''d say it was BradP, but Im not! whoever you are its a shot to be proud of.</td>', 'This is my favourite of the whole challenge! Its really stands out from the crowd, and kudos for spotting it in the first place. If I were a betting man I''d say it was BradP, but Im not! whoever you are its a shot to be proud of.', '2005-09-19 08:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720438, 232703, 13879, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I like the pose and the choice of background, especially the shadow. I''m guessing you processed his eyes a bit (at least I hope so!) which I think are excellent, even from the thumbnail they grab my attention. It reminds me of "bladerunner" or a 50''s detective story, so IMO fits the challenge brilliantly - you''ve captured the mood well. I hope top 10, I''d go further but I dont want to jinx you!</td>', 'Nice shot! I like the pose and the choice of background, especially the shadow. I''m guessing you processed his eyes a bit (at least I hope so!) which I think are excellent, even from the thumbnail they grab my attention. It reminds me of "bladerunner" or a 50''s detective story, so IMO fits the challenge brilliantly - you''ve captured the mood well. I hope top 10, I''d go further but I dont want to jinx you!', '2005-09-19 08:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720440, 232749, 13879, '<td valign="top">Agent Lawrence I presume! Cool shot, I gotta get me a smoke machine, good luck dood, its gotta be top 10 at least!</td>', 'Agent Lawrence I presume! Cool shot, I gotta get me a smoke machine, good luck dood, its gotta be top 10 at least!', '2005-09-19 08:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720443, 232684, 13879, '<td valign="top">My favourite of all the ''moon shots'', really nicely done, just wish the part we are looking through was a tad more in focus, but its still really effective. Good luck</td>', 'My favourite of all the ''moon shots'', really nicely done, just wish the part we are looking through was a tad more in focus, but its still really effective. Good luck', '2005-09-19 08:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720449, 232608, 13879, '<td valign="top">I really like the way this is done, makes me want to see more of the scene! good job</td>', 'I really like the way this is done, makes me want to see more of the scene! good job', '2005-09-19 08:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720451, 232665, 13879, '<td valign="top">Viva la Revolution! <br/>one of the most disturbing shots I''ve seen on DPC! great job</td>', 'Viva la Revolution! one of the most disturbing shots I''ve seen on DPC! great job', '2005-09-19 08:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720457, 232742, 13879, '<td valign="top">That must have taken AGES!!! I always appreciate a good setup, I do like the lighting but I wish I could see the lighter a bit more clearly. Still a very creative shot, and you get bonus points for it being a speed challenge. Good luck</td>', 'That must have taken AGES!!! I always appreciate a good setup, I do like the lighting but I wish I could see the lighter a bit more clearly. Still a very creative shot, and you get bonus points for it being a speed challenge. Good luck', '2005-09-19 08:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720458, 232046, 13879, '<td valign="top">LOL! Dood you have a SCARY ammount of woodies! That said I do like your setup, the black background works well and I appreciate the lighting (something I find really tricky!). Good luck</td>', 'LOL! Dood you have a SCARY ammount of woodies! That said I do like your setup, the black background works well and I appreciate the lighting (something I find really tricky!). Good luck', '2005-09-19 08:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720463, 232759, 13879, '<td valign="top">WOW this looks really sinister! I like the lighting (like the highlights on the nails) and what looks like selective desat. I cant make my mind up about the background, if it were plain white it''d be really boring, but I find the small creases (where its been folded) a bit distracting. Still its one of my favourites in the challenge. good luck!</td>', 'WOW this looks really sinister! I like the lighting (like the highlights on the nails) and what looks like selective desat. I cant make my mind up about the background, if it were plain white it''d be really boring, but I find the small creases (where its been folded) a bit distracting. Still its one of my favourites in the challenge. good luck!', '2005-09-19 08:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720466, 232711, 13879, '<td valign="top">Such a cool shot, so simple but really effective. Gotta be a top 10...at least!</td>', 'Such a cool shot, so simple but really effective. Gotta be a top 10...at least!', '2005-09-19 08:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720797, 232090, 36981, '<td valign="top">I like this concept &amp; composition.  I little more sharpness on the horses and a little more contrast in the background would have really improved this image, IMO.</td>', 'I like this concept & composition.  I little more sharpness on the horses and a little more contrast in the background would have really improved this image, IMO.', '2005-09-19 11:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720805, 232352, 36981, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this because I''m not sure what to make of it, or even what it is.  I like the diagonal and the symettry of the background, and the color scheme is intriguing, but I don''t understand what the heck it is!</td>', 'I keep coming back to this because I''m not sure what to make of it, or even what it is.  I like the diagonal and the symettry of the background, and the color scheme is intriguing, but I don''t understand what the heck it is!', '2005-09-19 11:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720807, 232646, 36981, '<td valign="top">Funny, but I''m not fnd of the purple cast.  Probably a little too gross for me to contemplate.</td>', 'Funny, but I''m not fnd of the purple cast.  Probably a little too gross for me to contemplate.', '2005-09-19 11:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720810, 232775, 36981, '<td valign="top">V funny - cute cat!  Great detail on her fur.  How did you ever get her to put up with that?</td>', 'V funny - cute cat!  Great detail on her fur.  How did you ever get her to put up with that?', '2005-09-19 11:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720814, 232265, 36981, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I really like the DOF you chose, and the composition is great.  I kind of wish that the flag went across the whole background, but I''m not sure about that.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I really like the DOF you chose, and the composition is great.  I kind of wish that the flag went across the whole background, but I''m not sure about that.', '2005-09-19 11:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720827, 232750, 36981, '<td valign="top">It does seem like a conspiracy, doesn''t it?  Great take on the challenge, but not the most interesting image to me.  I wish that the tree tops either were not there at all, or were more visible, and that the sky were a more interesting color.  That said, I love the concept, so 7.</td>', 'It does seem like a conspiracy, doesn''t it?  Great take on the challenge, but not the most interesting image to me.  I wish that the tree tops either were not there at all, or were more visible, and that the sky were a more interesting color.  That said, I love the concept, so 7.', '2005-09-19 11:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1720832, 232056, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and I like the way the black bird is looking a bit paranoid.  I wish the colors popped a bit more on the water, but a good shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Great idea, and I like the way the black bird is looking a bit paranoid.  I wish the colors popped a bit more on the water, but a good shot nonetheless.', '2005-09-19 11:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
