(1720837, 232549, 36981, '<td valign="top">I like this image, and the concept is great.  I wish there were a little more focus, although I realize you may have blurred it intentionally for a more mysterious feel.</td>', 'I like this image, and the concept is great.  I wish there were a little more focus, although I realize you may have blurred it intentionally for a more mysterious feel.', '2005-09-19 11:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
