(1721049, 232336, 21216, '<td valign="top">Was this taken from the Pepsi Cola sign? Ah I miss New York and this picture kind of makes me miss it a lot more. I love the composition, the beautiful background the doubts (That are on every guy''s mind whom a camera is pointed towards) yet the lighting really seems unatural, not at all flashy, looks like a copy and paste :-/ I''m not sure but it''s still a great pic.</td>', 'Was this taken from the Pepsi Cola sign? Ah I miss New York and this picture kind of makes me miss it a lot more. I love the composition, the beautiful background the doubts (That are on every guy''s mind whom a camera is pointed towards) yet the lighting really seems unatural, not at all flashy, looks like a copy and paste :-/ I''m not sure but it''s still a great pic.', '2005-09-19 12:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
