(1721691, 232759, 36981, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is too freaky.  I truly hate shots.  Good take on the challenge, good composition.  I think a little more light on the hand might have helped make this stronger, but I''m not sure about that.</td>', 'Oh, this is too freaky.  I truly hate shots.  Good take on the challenge, good composition.  I think a little more light on the hand might have helped make this stronger, but I''m not sure about that.', '2005-09-19 18:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
