(1721702, 232460, 36981, '<td valign="top">I smell a rat!  Actually, these are adorable, and I like your caption.  Reminds me of Peter Pan being forced to walk the plank.  I wish we could see the falling one from the other side - I''d love to see his expression!</td>', 'I smell a rat!  Actually, these are adorable, and I like your caption.  Reminds me of Peter Pan being forced to walk the plank.  I wish we could see the falling one from the other side - I''d love to see his expression!', '2005-09-19 18:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1721707, 232408, 36981, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I''ve come back a couple of times trying to determine what this is.  At first I thought the black shadow on the right was the silhouette of a person''s head, which made me like this more, but now I''m thinking that it''s a finger holding onto this glowy thing (mainly because it seems to have an opposite number on the left).  I still like the colors, but the grooves on the outside ring are distracting me a little.</td>', 'Interesting.  I''ve come back a couple of times trying to determine what this is.  At first I thought the black shadow on the right was the silhouette of a person''s head, which made me like this more, but now I''m thinking that it''s a finger holding onto this glowy thing (mainly because it seems to have an opposite number on the left).  I still like the colors, but the grooves on the outside ring are distracting me a little.', '2005-09-19 18:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
