(1724601, 232265, 21714, '<td valign="top">He didn''t say ''young'', did he?  I thought it was ''I didn''t have sex with that woman, Miss Lewinsky''.<br/>Well I am assuming a lot because of the red striped in the background (don''t really know about the cigar). I am assuming Bill Clinton and Monica Lewinsky. You might have created your own, that''s got nothing to do with Bill or Monica, but something like this would make people think of things that''s fed into their brains by the media, and you have to accept that, don''t you think?<br/>If it''s really that famous case, I am wondering what the conspiracy is here. When we all find out that it actually happened, it''s no longer a conspiracy, is it?<br/>I like the shot besides the questions I have.</td>', 'He didn''t say ''young'', did he?  I thought it was ''I didn''t have sex with that woman, Miss Lewinsky''.Well I am assuming a lot because of the red striped in the background (don''t really know about the cigar). I am assuming Bill Clinton and Monica Lewinsky. You might have created your own, that''s got nothing to do with Bill or Monica, but something like this would make people think of things that''s fed into their brains by the media, and you have to accept that, don''t you think?If it''s really that famous case, I am wondering what the conspiracy is here. When we all find out that it actually happened, it''s no longer a conspiracy, is it?I like the shot besides the questions I have.', '2005-09-20 17:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
