(1731951, 232558, 39349, '<td valign="top">Um, I''m just not really getting this shot at all. It''s not that it''s bad, I just don''t see how it fits into this challenge. <br/> <br/>With that said, the lighting is good, DOF is right on. Watch face seems a tad burnt out on my end but overall an interesting shot.<br/></td>', 'Um, I''m just not really getting this shot at all. It''s not that it''s bad, I just don''t see how it fits into this challenge.  With that said, the lighting is good, DOF is right on. Watch face seems a tad burnt out on my end but overall an interesting shot.', '2005-09-22 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1731961, 232688, 39349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea but the execution could have been better IMHO. Entire shot seems out of focus and I do not really like the angle of the truck. I would try different angles and playing with the contrast / brightness / hue''s in post processing to make a more dramatic effect on a wonderful idea.<br/></td>', 'Wonderful idea but the execution could have been better IMHO. Entire shot seems out of focus and I do not really like the angle of the truck. I would try different angles and playing with the contrast / brightness / hue''s in post processing to make a more dramatic effect on a wonderful idea.', '2005-09-22 22:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1731970, 232744, 39349, '<td valign="top">Another great idea but the execution could have been better. I see the fire but don''t arsonists work alone most of the time? I think your shot would have more impact if we could see more of the flames and expressions on the faces perhaps?</td>', 'Another great idea but the execution could have been better. I see the fire but don''t arsonists work alone most of the time? I think your shot would have more impact if we could see more of the flames and expressions on the faces perhaps?', '2005-09-22 22:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1731983, 232355, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay this is in no way meant to be rude but this shot really does nothing for me. I like the contrast of the sunset but the interaction of the people in the shot really just leaves me confused. 4</td>', 'Okay this is in no way meant to be rude but this shot really does nothing for me. I like the contrast of the sunset but the interaction of the people in the shot really just leaves me confused. 4', '2005-09-22 22:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
