(1732050, 232660, 39349, '<td valign="top">I loved the X Files and this character was one that made the series for me. You''ve done a wonderful job of creating the feeling and mysteriousness of this classic character. 10</td>', 'I loved the X Files and this character was one that made the series for me. You''ve done a wonderful job of creating the feeling and mysteriousness of this classic character. 10', '2005-09-22 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
