(1732373, 232374, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. This is well conceived and executed. I like the selective desat and noise. The over exposure on and around the phone take a little away from a great job.</td>', 'One of my favorites. This is well conceived and executed. I like the selective desat and noise. The over exposure on and around the phone take a little away from a great job.', '2005-09-23 00:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732374, 232749, 44744, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, good lighting and very nice smoke. Especially interesting how the model scans the darkness, recieving message at the same time. I find it a bit distracting to see the grass in the left corner and only half of his face. On the other hand, the lighting on the lit part of the face could have suffered if another lightsource added. Very nice job.</td>', 'Very nice photo, good lighting and very nice smoke. Especially interesting how the model scans the darkness, recieving message at the same time. I find it a bit distracting to see the grass in the left corner and only half of his face. On the other hand, the lighting on the lit part of the face could have suffered if another lightsource added. Very nice job.', '2005-09-23 00:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1732377, 232046, 33672, '<td valign="top">Hope, revenge, passion!...... I can''t wait for the movie!  I like that the photo tells a story.</td>', 'Hope, revenge, passion!...... I can''t wait for the movie!  I like that the photo tells a story.', '2005-09-23 00:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
