(4786439, 232665, 30807, '<td valign="top">Hmm... Too many sci-fi films for you, my man!<br/> <br/>It triggers a memory of a scene from the alien ''invasion'' series, with about 25 people looking up out of a pond or lake, and they are all happy to be in there. I suspect that a clone would look asleep if there was one - he looks like he was snap-frozen alive<br/> <br/>Nice shot - I would love to see the set up pix for it.<br/> <br/>My only concern is that there are some real-life nutters (english phrase) or head-cases, who might try this for real - you just DONT want to give them ideas. <br/> <br/>What would you do for a shot about the Resurrection, I wonder? - would love to see it</td>', 'Hmm... Too many sci-fi films for you, my man! It triggers a memory of a scene from the alien ''invasion'' series, with about 25 people looking up out of a pond or lake, and they are all happy to be in there. I suspect that a clone would look asleep if there was one - he looks like he was snap-frozen alive Nice shot - I would love to see the set up pix for it. My only concern is that there are some real-life nutters (english phrase) or head-cases, who might try this for real - you just DONT want to give them ideas.  What would you do for a shot about the Resurrection, I wonder? - would love to see it', '2008-06-26 07:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
